(notes "Cycles: one person against the house. The arrows steer your cursor, which writes every cell it enters; a cursor that enters a written cell has closed a circle and loses the round. Enter or Space begins a round, P pauses. The house's every reason is a cell of the Mind sheet. A cell filled on the Layout sheet is a wall from the next round.")
